  "goodToKnow": "Der Nachahmer is an imitator or copycat: Die Idee fand viele Nachahmer. Nachahmen means to imitate, a bit more formal than nachmachen. Der Nachahmungstäter is a copycat offender. The Werther effect, increased suicides after media coverage, is named after Goethe's novel Die Leiden des jungen Werthers (1774), which was blamed for imitations; it's why German media report carefully on suicides. The plural is the same."
